Short:        Standard C library as a shared lib. V3.0
Author:       Robert W Albrecht
Version:      3.0
Architecture: m68k-amigaos
Source:       Fish collection

An implementation of the standard C runtime library, with a few extra
goodies thrown in.  Supports a large number of functions including stream
I/O, low-level I/O, string, memory, linked list, sorting, time, process
control and more.
